WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.337
Leo is back from his vacation. Let's ask him some questions!

2
00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:11.199
Hi, Leo! Welcome back! Where did you go on your vacation?

3
00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:13.599
I went to Canada with my family!

4
00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.078
Cool! Where did you stay?

5
00:00:18.528 --> 00:00:20.850
I stayed at my cousin's house in Toronto.

6
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.540
Did it snow?

7
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.844
Yes, it did! It snowed every day. It was very cold!

8
00:00:31.094 --> 00:00:33.324
Did you visit Niagara Falls?

9
00:00:33.774 --> 00:00:35.863
Yes, I did! It was amazing.

10
00:00:38.113 --> 00:00:39.367
What did you eat?

11
00:00:39.817 --> 00:00:42.511
I ate pancakes with maple syrup every morning!

12
00:00:44.761 --> 00:00:46.711
Did you go ice skating?

13
00:00:47.161 --> 00:00:50.458
No, I didn't. I was scared! But my cousin went.

14
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:54.194
Did you like the trip?

15
00:00:54.644 --> 00:00:56.502
Yes, I did. I loved it!

16
00:00:56.952 --> 00:01:00.482
And you? Where did you go on your last vacation?

